flowchart TB
    subgraph process["Scheduler + Binder 进程（合并部署，同一进程地址空间）"]
        direction TB

        subgraph scheduler["Scheduler 模块"]
            direction TB
            S_algo[Filter / Score / Reserve<br/>调度决策]:::sched
            S_snap[Snapshot 读取<br/>Node/Pod 信息]:::sched
        end

        subgraph adapter["CacheAdapter 桥接层"]
            direction TB
            A_local["本地状态<br/>assumedPods map<br/>podMarkers map"]:::adapter
            A_delegate["委托方法<br/>GetPod / IsAssumedPod<br/>AssumePod / ForgetPod<br/>Add/Update/DeletePod"]:::adapter
            A_extra["Binder 专属方法<br/>FinishBinding<br/>MarkPodToDelete"]:::adapter
        end

        subgraph binder["ENO Binder 模块"]
            direction TB
            B_bind[BinderInterface.BindUnit<br/>Pod Bind API]:::binder
            B_reserve[FinishReserving<br/>确认绑定]:::binder
        end

        SC[("SchedulerCache<br/>（单一内存实例）<br/>NodeInfo / PodInfo<br/>Assumed / Reserved 状态<br/>Snapshot")]:::cache

        S_algo -->|读写| SC
        S_snap -.->|快照读| SC
        A_delegate -->|delegate| SC
        A_extra -->|delegate<br/>FinishReserving| SC

        B_bind -->|通过 CacheAdapter| A_local
        B_bind -->|通过 CacheAdapter| A_delegate
        B_reserve -->|通过 CacheAdapter| A_extra
    end

    Note1["⚡ 关键：SchedulerCache 是单一内存实例<br/>Scheduler 与 ENO Binder 通过<br/>CacheAdapter 引用同一份数据，<br/>无拷贝、无序列化、无 Informer 同步延迟"]:::note

